From 0a0d189d273796da91df9260ea32c00aa6777ad5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 09:28:50 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] fix(verify): a raw-stock-only mark holds only while its
 model prints the same

Third review of PR #1097: DeleteFixture removed a marked model without
dropping its mark, the fourth command that had to remember. The mark
now carries a 128-bit fingerprint of the source model's geometry as
the verdict reads it (facet count, local vertex bits, placement bits;
FNV-1a and splitmix64 lanes, memoised per revision), and stock_source
honours it only while a model of that name is the stock's source and
prints the same; any mismatch voids it with a named note on the
gate's visible line. The project file saves the print beside the
flag; a flag without one loads unmarked with a note. DeleteFixture
gains the tidiness drop the other removers have.

Fixes #1094

